    "chunk_text": "lend \u00fee is genemned Crist. Eornostlice ealle cneoressa fram Abrahame o\u00f0 Dauid synd feowertyne cneoressa, & fram Dauide o\u00f0 So\u00f0lice \u00feus w\u00e6s Cristes cneores; \u00f0a \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes modor Maria w\u00e6s Iosepe beweddod, \u00e6r hi So\u00f0lice Iosep hyre wer \u00f0a he w\u00e6s rihtwis & nolde hi gewidm\u00e6rsian, he wolde hi dihlice forl\u00e6tan. Him \u00fea so\u00f0lice \u00f0as \u00feing \u00f0encendum Drihtnes engel on swefnum \u00e6tywde & him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, Iosep, Witodlice heo cen\u00f0 sunu & \u00feu nemst hys naman H\u00e6lend. He so\u00f0lice hys folc hal gede\u00f0 fram hyra synnum. So\u00felice eal \u00feys w\u00e6s geworden \u00fe\u00e6t gefylled w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t fram Drihtne gecweden w\u00e6s \u00feurh \u00feone So\u00f0lice seo f\u00e6mne h\u00e6f\u00f0 on inno\u00f0e & heo cen\u00f0 sunu & hi nemna\u00f0 his naman Emanuhel, \u00fe\u00e6t ys \u00d0a aras Iosep of swefene & dyde swa Drihtnes engel him bebead, & he onfeng his gem\u00e6ccean. & he ne grette hi; Heo cende hyre frumcennedan sunu & nemde hys naman H\u00e6lend. Eornustlice \u00fea se H\u00e6lend acenned w\u00e6s on Iudeiscre Bethleem on \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges dagum Herodes; \u00fea & cw\u00e6don, hw\u00e6r ys se Iudea cyning \u00fee acenned ys; So\u00f0lice we gesawon hys steorran on eastd\u00e6le & \u00d0a Herodes \u00fe\u00e6t gehyrde \u00f0a wear\u00f0 he gedrefed & eal Hierosolimwaru mid him. & \u00fea geg",
